&lt;p&gt;Mr. Jas E. Heauner&lt;br&gt;
Lebanon, Mo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Received your letter. Will write soon. Be sure and let me know when you are coming and I’ll answer you the way will be clear.&lt;br&gt;
Q.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
